  "witness_units": "t: seconds from admission origin_perf_s; age_s: recorded external-arrival age; free_blocks: physical free KV pages; budget_*_blocks: separate declared virtual pages. Each page has 16 tokens. Unique IDs are native request IDs within one arm.",
